  "details": "I get you can send messages via invite or a request. But there should be a message system to be able to continue a conversation without having to keep sending different invites or requests when you run out of space. When I use that system most of the time I have friends that don’t even see the message and just join. Like I will just send a “hii, just checking on ya” message and then i have to leave and feel bad when they join bc they don’t see the message at all.",
